# 暂停菜单：＋ 开总面板、L 三次切到暂停页（暂停页在默认页签左边第三个），截图，B 关回局内
# Pause menu: + opens the combined panel, L three times moves to the pause page (third tab left of the default), screenshot, B back to the game
name pause_menu
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
open_pause
shot pause.png
close_pause
expect_state in_game=true
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
